# Browser port disc image IS tracked so every mc3.top visitor can sign in and play.
# Do NOT add templates/game/out/wasm/disc.iso or templates/game/out/wasm/disc.iso.* to .gitignore.
# The browser build requires these files and must NOT be removed:
#   tools/web/play.html, gpu.js, webgpu_backend.cpp, web_audio.cpp, web_stubs.cpp,
#   build_wasm.py, serve.py, stage_site.py,
#   tools/multiplayer/browser/static/relay-client.js, account-ui.js,
#   tools/multiplayer/browser/play/ (staged site output),
#   tools/multiplayer/cloudflare/ (mc3.top Worker deployment)
!templates/game/out/wasm/disc.iso
!templates/game/out/wasm/disc.iso.*

